        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram Tong Hop - Quan ly Sach (7 Tinh huong)\n\nautonumber\nactor \&quot;Nhan vien kho\&quot; as Staff\nboundary \&quot;Giao dien Quan ly Sach\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Sach Controller\&quot; as BookCtrl\nentity \&quot;Sach\&quot; as BookEntity\nentity \&quot;Ton kho\&quot; as KhoEntity\n\nactivate Staff\n\n&#39; 1. Cập nhật thông tin sách &amp; 2. Thêm mới sách &amp; 3. Chỉnh sửa &amp; 4. Xóa sách &amp; 5. Kiểm tra dữ liệu\ngroup 1. Quan ly, Them, Sua, Xoa va Kiem tra du lieu sach\n    Staff -&gt; UI: Chon tinh nang Quan ly / Them / Sua / Xoa sach\n    activate UI\n    \n    alt Them moi / Chinh sua sach\n        UI -&gt; BookCtrl: thucHienThemHoacSuaSach(thongTin)\n        activate BookCtrl\n        \n        &#39; Use-case Kiểm tra dữ liệu (Include)\n        BookCtrl -&gt; BookCtrl: validateData(ISBN, Ten, Gia)\n        alt Du lieu khong hop le / Trùng ISBN / Gia &lt;= 0\n            BookCtrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao loi du lieu\n        else Du lieu hop le\n            BookCtrl -&gt; BookEntity: saveOrUpdateSach(thongTin)\n            activate BookEntity\n            BookEntity --&gt; BookCtrl: Xac nhan luu thanh cong\n            deactivate BookEntity\n            BookCtrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao thao tac thanh cong\n        end\n        deactivate BookCtrl\n        \n    else Xoa sach\n        UI -&gt; BookCtrl: xoaSach(maSach)\n        activate BookCtrl\n        BookCtrl -&gt; BookEntity: kiemTraLichSuGiaoDich(maSach)\n        activate BookEntity\n        alt Sach da co giao dich\n            BookEntity --&gt; BookCtrl: Co giao dich\n            BookCtrl -&gt; BookEntity: updateTrangThai(\&quot;NgungKinhDoanh\&quot;)\n            BookEntity --&gt; BookCtrl: Xac nhan\n            BookCtrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao chuyen trang thai Ngung kinh doanh\n        else Sach chua co giao dich\n            BookEntity --&gt; BookCtrl: Chua co giao dich\n            BookCtrl -&gt; BookEntity: deleteSach(maSach)\n            BookEntity --&gt; BookCtrl: Xac nhan\n            BookCtrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao xoa sach thanh cong\n        end\n        deactivate BookEntity\n        deactivate BookCtrl\n    end\n    UI --&gt; Staff: Hoan tat quy trình cập nhật sách\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\n&#39; 6. Tra cứu thông tin sách &amp; 7. Xem chi tiết sách\ngroup 2. Tra cuu thong tin &amp; Xem chi tiet sach (kem ton kho)\n    Staff -&gt; UI: Nhap bo loc &amp; thuc hien Tra cuu / Xem chi tiet\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; BookCtrl: traCuuVaXemChiTietSach(boLoc, maSach)\n    activate BookCtrl\n    \n    BookCtrl -&gt; BookEntity: searchSach(boLoc)\n    activate BookEntity\n    BookEntity --&gt; BookCtrl: Tra ve danh sach ket qua\n    deactivate BookEntity\n    \n    BookCtrl -&gt; BookEntity: getDetailSach(maSach)\n    activate BookEntity\n    BookEntity --&gt; BookCtrl: Tra ve thuoc tinh chi tiet\n    deactivate BookEntity\n    \n    BookCtrl -&gt; KhoEntity: getSoLuongTon(maSach)\n    activate KhoEntity\n    KhoEntity --&gt; BookCtrl: Tra ve so luong ton kho thuc te\n    deactivate KhoEntity\n    \n    BookCtrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi danh sach, thong tin chi tiet va ton kho\n    deactivate BookCtrl\n    UI --&gt; Staff: Hien thi ket qua day du cho nhan vien kho\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\ndeactivate Staff\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="Ln_H3_Tu1AUYDjyUfakF-1">
